Fireflies: scalable, intrusion-tolerant group membership for peer-to-peer
overlays. See doc/fireflies.pdf.

Licensing

Fireflies is under the MIT licence (LICENCE), with two exceptions:

- fireflies/setrecon/*.cpp and *.h implement set reconciliation. They are
  by Sachin Agarwal and Ari Trachtenberg (Boston University), modified for
  Fireflies, and remain under GPL version 2 (fireflies/setrecon/COPYING).
  The compiled extension, fireflies.setrecon._setreconbase, is therefore
  GPL, and so is any distribution that includes it.
- scripts/vxargs is by Yun Mao (University of Pennsylvania) and is under the
  GNU LGPL, as stated in its header.
